WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.274
O ɗon wi'a ko o woni. Fedde dagara.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.124
Wakkati naane, gure dagara'en mbaawataa haayri. Nyalnde nden e woodi ɓernde kalluɗum. Yimɓe ɗon ngi'a hakkunde maɓɓe, ɓe ngaɗata ko wooɗi.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.368
Go'o go'o Bayuo, mawɗo geɗal, ɓeydi haa nder leɗɗe.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.112
Nde jemma waɗi, o yi'i laawol.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.048
Ɗoon o nani wolde mo anndaa.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.920
Ɓaawo leɗɗe, ruuhuuji nder ladde ɗon mbaroyi lekki.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.650
Bayuo yejjiti kulol muuɗum. O meeɗaay nanugo ko ɓuri wooɗugo.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.072
O warti haa jemma, nden kam o ɓoydi dow leggal.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:59.258
Lewru ɗon wayla nokkuure maako. Ammaa juuɗe maako ɗe laatoy, ɗon ɓeyda ɓeydagol ruumiije.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.762
Ɗerewol gootol ɓanngini. Wonaa !

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.340
Honooɓe ɓe'e nana en?

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:25.270
Mi hokkata on beerol ngol. Hokka mi huutoroo!

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:31.452
Mawɓe ɗon ndaara. Sey ɓe mbi'i mo: "Ndaa.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.794
Bayuo waɗi. O hoo'i kooɗume.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.210
Fulii lamɓe nder leggal ngal. Ɗaɓɓo.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:58.768
Nde o wari nder gariiri ndin, o taƴi lamɓe, o hokki ɓe limce.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.496
Kanko woni neɗɗo arandeeɗo worɓe.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:35.258
Nde ɓe nganndi, koyɗe maɓɓe fuɗɗii ɓeydaade. Yimɓe nder gariiri fuu njogii.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:48.984
Ɗon wakkati, yimɓe ɗiɗo ɗon ngi'a bee ɓerɗe maɓɓe.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:14.714
Diga saa'i maajum, Muritanko'en ɗon yahda bee Dagara'en nder juulde e boo nder rewo. O ɗon yahda bee mayde e yonki.
